{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"沃伦·巴菲特·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"warren-buffett","categoryLabel":"沃伦·巴菲特","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/34_warren-buffett/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"沃伦-巴菲特-核心贡献\">沃伦·巴菲特·核心贡献</h1><h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位\">本 hub 的定位</h2><p>本 hub 回答一个问题：<strong>巴菲特究竟给投资与商业世界留下了什么可被验证、可被学习的实质贡献？</strong> 它不讲他的生平，也不空谈&quot;伟大&quot;，而是把三类核心贡献拆成可核验的机制与案例：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>价值投资体系</strong>——他如何把格雷厄姆的学院方法，验证并普及为全球通行的投资框架；</li>\n<li><strong>伯克希尔帝国的运作内核</strong>——保险浮存金这台资金引擎，与&quot;集中配置 + 极端分权&quot;的独特集团结构；</li>\n<li><strong>经典投资案例</strong>——喜诗糖果、可口可乐与长期组合，把理念落成可核验的财务账本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>判定贡献是否成立，用的是同一把尺子：1965–2024 年，伯克希尔每股账面价值年化增长约 18.1%、股价约 19.9%，而同期标普 500 全收益指数约 10.4%（来源：伯克希尔 2024 年报致股东信，SEC EDGAR）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-分工边界\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub（分工边界）</h2><p>巴菲特人物条目共有六个 hub，本 hub 专注&quot;贡献的内容与机制&quot;，刻意不重复其他 hub 的内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它讲什么</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>童年、求学、接管伯克希尔的历程</td>\n<td>本 hub 不讲传记，只讲贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>能力圈、市场先生、护城河、与芒格的合伙</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲&quot;做了什么&quot;，那里讲&quot;怎么想&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要成就</a></td>\n<td>复利记录、致股东信、慈善</td>\n<td>那里是成就的&quot;展示与数字&quot;，本 hub 是贡献的&quot;机制拆解&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>对后世投资者与企业的影响</td>\n<td>本 hub 是&quot;贡献本身&quot;，那里是&quot;贡献的涟漪&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>错过科技、衍生品、规模与继任问题</td>\n<td>本 hub 给正面贡献，那里给批判性审视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>思想与方法 = 怎么想；本 hub 核心贡献 = 做了什么、靠什么机制；影响与遗产 = 留下了什么涟漪。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[前置: 思想与方法&lt;br/&gt;能力圈/护城河] --&gt; A[1 价值投资&lt;br/&gt;框架与估值]&#10;    A --&gt; B[2 伯克希尔帝国&lt;br/&gt;浮存金+集团结构]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 经典投资&lt;br/&gt;案例与组合]&#10;    C --&gt; N[延伸: 争议与评价&lt;br/&gt;局限与风险]\">flowchart LR\n    P[前置: 思想与方法&lt;br/&gt;能力圈/护城河] --&gt; A[1 价值投资&lt;br/&gt;框架与估值]\n    A --&gt; B[2 伯克希尔帝国&lt;br/&gt;浮存金+集团结构]\n    B --&gt; C[3 经典投资&lt;br/&gt;案例与组合]\n    C --&gt; N[延伸: 争议与评价&lt;br/&gt;局限与风险]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置（建议先读）</strong>：兄弟 hub <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/circle-of-competence\">能力圈</a> 与 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/the-moat-concept\">护城河概念</a>——本 hub 多处以它们为基础概念。</li>\n<li><strong>第 1 章 价值投资</strong>：先读 <a href=\"value-investing/the-value-investing-approach\">价值投资之道</a>（操作框架），再读 <a href=\"value-investing/intrinsic-value-and-margin-of-safety\">内在价值与安全边际</a>（估值机制）。</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章 伯克希尔帝国</strong>：先读 <a href=\"the-berkshire-empire/the-insurance-float-model\">保险浮存金模式</a>（资金引擎），再读 <a href=\"the-berkshire-empire/the-conglomerate\">多元企业集团</a>（组织结构）。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章 经典投资</strong>：先读 <a href=\"landmark-investments/sees-candies-and-coca-cola\">喜诗糖果与可口可乐</a>（单案例），再读 <a href=\"landmark-investments/the-long-term-portfolio\">长期投资组合</a>（组合方法论）。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸（读完再补）</strong>：兄弟 hub <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>，避免把贡献神化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者\">适合读者</h2><p>希望理解&quot;巴菲特方法到底是什么、为什么有效、又在哪里受限&quot;的投资者、商科学生与对商业史感兴趣的读者。本 hub 假设你已具备基础财务概念（市盈率、现金流、复利），但不要求专业金融背景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节一览\">章节一览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"value-investing/\">价值投资</a></td>\n<td>视股票为生意、安全边际、内在价值估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-berkshire-empire/\">伯克希尔帝国</a></td>\n<td>保险浮存金模式、多元控股集团结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"landmark-investments/\">经典投资</a></td>\n<td>喜诗/可口可乐案例、集中长持的组合方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"value-investing","title":"价值投资","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/value-investing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-value-investing-approach","title":"价值投资之道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/value-investing/the-value-investing-approach"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intrinsic-value-and-margin-of-safety","title":"内在价值与安全边际","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/value-investing/intrinsic-value-and-margin-of-safety"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-berkshire-empire","title":"伯克希尔帝国","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-insurance-float-model","title":"保险浮存金模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire/the-insurance-float-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-conglomerate","title":"多元企业集团","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire/the-conglomerate"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"landmark-investments","title":"经典投资","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/landmark-investments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sees-candies-and-coca-cola","title":"喜诗糖果与可口可乐","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/landmark-investments/sees-candies-and-coca-cola"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-long-term-portfolio","title":"长期投资组合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/landmark-investments/the-long-term-portfolio"}]}]}